,\"active\":true,\"description\":\"A 90-minute, horse-centered drop-in group where preteens ages 9\\u201312 can connect with peers, build confidence, and practice communication and emotional-awareness skills through hands-on activities with horses. All horsemanship activities are completed on the ground; there is no riding. No previous horse experience is needed.\",\"duration\":90,\"price\":\"60.00\",\"category\":\"ZEAL- Therapy Programs\",\"color\":\"#73C1ED\",\"private\":false,\"type\":\"class\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-s.acuityscheduling.com\\/appointmentType-97574449.jpg?1787779787\",\"classSize\":5,\"paddingAfter\":0,\"paddingBefore\":0,\"calendarIDs\":[14469022],\"addonIDs\":[],\"formIDs\":[2947793],\"paymentRequired\":true,\"isOnlinePaymentNotAllowed\":false,\"showSmsOptIn\":true,\"canChooseQuantity\":true,\"smsRemindersEnabled\":true},{\"id\":97574608,\"name\":\"Therapy with Kate Pearson, LSW\",\"active\":true,\"description\":\"Kate Pearson is available for both private and group therapy sessions at Zuma\\u2019s Rescue Ranch.\\nKate specializes in working with individuals impacted by trauma and related mental health challenges, using compassionate, client-centered support alongside the unique healing environment of the ranch. \\n\\nYou can reach out to Kate directly at Katelyn@summitpointcounseling.com if you have questions. \\n\",\"duration\":60,\"price\":\"90.00\",\"category\":\"ZEAL- Therapy Programs\",\"color\":\"#B7A6EB\",\"private\":false,\"type\":\"service\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-s.acuityscheduling.com\\/appointmentType-97574608.jpg?1787838360\",\"classSize\":null,\"paddingAfter\":0,\"paddingBefore\":0,\"calendarIDs\":[14469022],\"addonIDs\":[],\"formIDs\":[],\"paymentRequired\":true,\"isOnlinePaymentNotAllowed\":false,\"showSmsOptIn\":true,\"canChooseQuantity\":false,\"smsRemindersEnabled\":true},{\"id\":78539970,\"name\":\"Therapy with Misty Perry\",\"active\":true,\"description\":\"Mental Health services with LCSW Misty Perry - If you are 